The story follows Michael, alongside his colleagues Nadia and Daniel J. Hart—genetic scientists from the Epsilon Research Institute—who become stranded in a remote valley while conducting field research near a wildlife sanctuary. Cut off from safety and separated from his team, Michael’s search for his friends soon spirals into darkness, where fanatical cults, forgotten rituals, and malignant forces conjure a nightmare with no escape.

